## 📝 IMPORTANT NOTES FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT

### Site Architecture (CRITICAL - READ CAREFULLY)
- **Frontend (Headless Next.js)**: https://beta.unobtuse.com/ - The main public website
- **Backend (WordPress)**: https://beta.unobtuse.com/wordpress - Admin panel and CMS backend
- **GraphQL API**: https://beta.unobtuse.com/wordpress/graphql - Data endpoint for headless content
- **DO NOT CONFUSE**: The root domain serves the Next.js app, /wordpress serves the WordPress backend

### WordPress Content Integration
- Mock data currently used for case studies and portfolio items
- Replace with actual GraphQL queries once WordPress content is ready
- Elementor compatibility built into structure, ready for content integration

### Environment Variables Required
- WORDPRESS_API_URL: Server-side GraphQL endpoint
- NEXT_PUBLIC_WORDPRESS_API_URL: Client-side GraphQL endpoint
- Both should point to: https://beta.unobtuse.com/wordpress/graphql

